# ImageCrafter — local environment
#
# Secrets do NOT live in this repo. They live in Infisical
# (project imagecrafter-production, environment prod) and are fetched at
# runtime. A .env file with keys in it goes stale the moment it is written and
# becomes a leak vector; one real key sat in this very file, on a public repo,
# for nine months.
#
# So your .env holds ONLY the credentials that open the vault. Nothing else.
# Everything below is fetched from the vault by scripts/_infisical.ts.
#
# Get your machine-identity Client ID + Secret from the vault admin. The Client
# ID is not a secret; the Client Secret is — never commit or paste it.

INFISICAL_API_URL="http://10.8.8.18:8085"
INFRISCAL_CLIENT_ID=""
INFRISCAL_CLIENT_SECRET=""

# Vercel holds the same secrets as project environment variables, set through
# the Vercel dashboard/API — not from this file, and not from a CLI deploy.
